lang=EN-ZA style='font-family:"Century Gothic",sans-serif'>2.8 <span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>      </span>Where applicable The <b>Service Provider </b>must
contact the Carrier and/or other Third Party within 24 (<span class=GramE>twenty
four</span>) hours to attend a joint survey. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
