in respect of the results of the investigation and provide <b>Mitig8 </b>with
same, together with any documentary evidence or photographs obtained by the <b>Service
Provider </b>during its investigation. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
150%'><span lang=EN-ZA style='font-family:"Century Gothic",sans-serif'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:0cm;
margin-left:36.0pt;margin-bottom:.0001pt;text-indent:-36.0pt;line-height:150%'><span
lang=EN-ZA style='font-family:"Century Gothic",sans-serif'>2.10 <span
style='mso-tab-count:1'>    </span>If an instruction appears complex and other
