instruction effectively the <b>Service Provider </b>shall immediately notify the
<b>Insurer</b> in question in writing hereof, detailing the areas of concern
and substantiating the <b>Service Provider’s </b>reasons for utilizing the
other Services. The <b>Service Provider </b>may not make use of these other
Services unless it has obtained the<b> Insurer’s</b> prior written authority. <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
150%'><span lang=EN-ZA style='font-family:"Century Gothic",sans-serif'><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

