Provider </b>must provide <b>Mitig8 </b>with valid reasons for such, in writing,
via email, telephone or through the <b style='mso-bidi-font-weight:normal'>Mitig8
</b>platform.<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-bottom:0cm;margin-bottom:.0001pt;line-height:
